# Show Details from the command menu lists the tags, and any key returns to editing at the same column.
file <<END
- Pay rent @due(2026-11-01) @flag
END
see Pay rent
keys <Enter> <Left> <Left> /
type show
keys <Enter>
see Details:
see @due(2026-11-01)
keys x
hide Details:
type Z
keys <Esc>
quit
saved <<END
- Pay reZnt @due(2026-11-01) @flag
END
